くれたから良かったよ。\nチーチャンカンビョー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなあみの必殺技求めに来てくれました(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"必殺技やったはやったで良いんだけど、どうしても剥がしの人に見られるのが最強に恥ずかしかった。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服はこれ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/09/28/0756589/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パーカー    LOWRYS FARM"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は4部も5部もゆるい感じだったよ〜笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに5部の服は撮るの忘れました。完全に。ごめんちゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/09/28/0756589/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/09/28/0756589/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう、誕生日の日の握手会、服をどーしょーか迷っててね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時期的にハロウィンだしなんか仮装っていうかコスプレみたいなのしたいなーって思ってるんだけどみんなどう思う？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなのがいっかな？？（＾_＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/09/28/0756589/0006.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-9692":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校始まったー！\nまた毎朝早く起きないと行けない。\nがんばるっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その後メンバー、スタッフさんと\n乃木神社にお参りしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おみくじは小吉だった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいのか悪いのか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は1月7日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"七草粥を食べる日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっ会のみなさん聞いて？！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...作りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...私が！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が、頑張ったろおおおお"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤家はいつも玄米を使っているので\nできあがりはお粥にしては\nちょっと硬かった。ので、\nお母さんはまた煮込みましたが...\n美味しかった。それなりに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はっあー！\nねねに自慢しよ←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんは七草粥食べましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今欲しい物は何ですか!?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー...特にこれというのはないけど\nハンドメイドのブローチ！\nブローチとか集めてるから"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハンドメイドっていうなら自分で\n作れやって話だけどね笑\n美容グッズも気になってる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新規まりっ会の会員は\nまず何をすればよいですか?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか推しでいてくださるだけで\nもうとっても嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まじめに、たまにゆるーくね！\nまりっ会に入会してくれて\nありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家ではよく、こんな\nルームウェアとか着るの？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...え！\n......え、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"着てない...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"子供扱いされたらやっぱり\nイラ立ちますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"慣れてる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"慣れてる。もん...\n子供じゃないいいうあああ！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、でも大人っぽくきれいに\nなりたいって本気で思ってるよ。うん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜発表の記事、\nコメントありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部読みました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...ごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"放送を見た直後に\n思ったことそのまま書こうとしたけど\nぐちゃぐちゃしちゃって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"強がった文しか書けませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんと喜び合いたい気持ち\nだけではなく、\n気持ちを共有することって\n大切ですよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって一緒に坂を登ってるんだもの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"強がってる私も\n弱気な私も\n受け入れてくださるみなさんが\n本当にだいすきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キリッ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャープに見える！わあい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-9334":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ちっさい団子／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は収録とリハだったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかライブいっぱい楽しみ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都の全握まりっかレーンに\n行くか迷ってるんですけど\nどーすればいいですかぁ？？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれないとすねる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"迷ったらあすかまりかレーン←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかのＰＶの曲発売の\n予定はないの？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...それがね！\n実は......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ないんだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おしるこには白玉派？お餅派？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うわうわうわー迷うやつ！\nそれは...えっ、どうしよう。\nお餅で！餅すき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかの家でクリスマスに必ず\n食べるものはある？...ケーキ以外で！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケーキ以外ね...\n............肉。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこの古着屋に行くんですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フラミンゴとサンタモニカ\nすきです。\n高円寺もいっぱいあって楽しいよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなロケしてみたい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"海外ロケ！どこでも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎年、初詣に行く？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行くよ^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カラオケ十八番はありますかー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"椎名林檎さんの\nカーネーション。\n相対性理論さんも歌うよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダッフィー\n何体くらい持ってますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ってません...！\n女の子は持ってるもんなのかな?\nたしかによく見かけるけど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかの神曲は、何？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部すきだけど\nなみころ、音が出ないギター\n毎日聴いてる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、1番作りたい料理は？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とん汁"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年末年始の特番でこれは絶対見る！\nっていうのはある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガキ使の罰ゲームは\n毎年録画してるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん。お笑い見たい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リクエストいっぱい\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふはは\nとりあえず締め切ります。\nものっそいリクエスト\nいっぱいきたので！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント読んでるうちに\nなんか難易度上がってきてた気が笑\nなんじゃそれみたいなのとか\nあーその発想おもしろい！\nみたいなのとか...\n楽しく読ませていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとずつだけどリクエストの\n写真撮ったら載っけるね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではさっそくいくよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その1あすかと2ショット"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(うしろにせいたん)\nあすかの顔ワッてやりたくなる。\nワッて。...わかる？←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都全握のレーンあすかと一緒♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅりんふぁむのみなさん\nよろしくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっ会のみなさんもよろしくね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/0924847/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はレコチョクライブ♪\n頑張る！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-59453":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JR0FSQQSV23GF344051NP9G0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はるよちゃんが襟直してくれたよ。\nお母さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日明後日はひな誕祭です！\nいい天気で迎えられますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昼は太陽てりてりで暖かいんだけど、\n夜になるとすごい風寒くなるから\n羽織るもの持っててもいいかもです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒がりさんは！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとライブ時間長いので、休憩とか御手洗とか適度に自分のタイミングで行ってくださいね😌"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上、現地からのリポートでした✌🏻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また明日ね。おやすみなさい。"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-nogi-40625":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHEVP8A3CZVK6SVFZTDNV9CJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">     先週のMステは皆さんチェックして頂けましたか？ まだまだ発売は先になってしまうけど早速初パフォーマンスさせて頂きました♡     トップバッターはやっぱり緊張しちゃうな〜それに階段降りる時にまいちゅんと何やるか一緒に考えたんだけど、まいちゅんに誘ってもらってあのポーズというか、顔？をしました！！！     また出れる日を楽しみにしてます♡  "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHEVP9CRBDWR5378K8YJ6ETE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">    *⃝̣◌⑅⃝◍♡◌*⃝̥◍♡*⃝̣◌⑅⃝◍♡◌*⃝̥◍♡     そして先日の握手会、蘭世とのペアレーン！！！ "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHEVPADKRY0S5E99HRSCHWNG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">    とっても楽しく皆がぐるぐる回ってくれたから足とか疲れてないですか？ゆっくり疲れを癒して下さいね？    そしてそんな蘭世も含んだかずみん まっちゅん 琴子 かりんちゃんめーちゃん てぃーちゃんとスタッフさんでBBQをしてきました♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡♡ "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHEVPBEMVMSVXB3WQMRXXPC1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"> ↑顎出してまっちゅんと遊んでみたよ（笑）琴子は通常通りだよ♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHEVPCDJ4XYMKZ8QKK9H6HVF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">  ラジオのお仕事があったのでちょっとしかいれなくてデザートのマシュマロが食べれなかった(TT) 焼きマシュマロ〜   焼きそばはね最後だったんだけど皆が早めに私が出ちゃうからってなるはやで焼いてくれたの優しい〜ありがとう♡♡♡♡     インスタ映えしそうなスポットが沢山あっててぃーちゃんと写真とりにいったんだけどここに載せきれないからまたぶろぐに載せますね（笑）  可愛い写真がいっぱい撮れたの（笑）    あ！心のインスタにはアップしてるので良ければ（笑）         それでは今日もお仕事頑張ってきます♡              たんたんたん ゆったんたん( •ㅈ• )               _       "}],"source":"archive"}}